{
  "title": "Oil Infused Saudi Arabian Lamb Tagine",
  "description": "A sweet and silky Saudi Arabian dish featuring lamb, perfect for a solo dinner, made with a vegetable stock cube and stir-fry method in a cazuela.",
  "cuisine": "Saudi Arabian",
